development.solution_text:
1. **Check that the network is connected**
The two rings of streets share the junction $C$, so every street can be reached from every other.
2. **Find the degree of every vertex**
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=1.0]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0);
\coordinate (B) at (2.6,0);
\coordinate (C) at (2.6,2.4);
